#. column 0: universal tomestone 3.0
#. column 2: universal tomestones 3.0
#. column 8: Having created a successful second iteration of the universal tomestone, researchers of yore continued to tweak and tinker, ultimately producing a data storage medium of such needless complexity that even they were left baffled by its functionality.
msgctxt "Item:49756:0:9"
msgid "Universal Tomestone 3.0"
msgstr "Универсальный томстоун 3.0"

